        "description": "<p><strong>Change size (Sp):</strong> Twice per day — works like <em>enlarge person</em> or <em>reduce person</em> (janni chooses); can target self; Fort negates (DC Charisma-based); equivalent spell level per SRD.</p><p><strong>Spell-like abilities:</strong> 3/day — <em>invisibility</em> (self only), <em>speak with animals</em>; 1/day — <em>create food and water</em>; 1/day <em>ethereal jaunt</em> for 1 hour — caster levels per stat block; DCs Charisma-based.</p><p><strong>Elemental endurance (Ex):</strong> Can remain on Elemental Planes Air, Earth, Fire, or Water up to 48 hours; each hour beyond deals 1 hp until the janni returns to the Material Plane or dies.</p><p><strong>Plane shift (Sp):</strong> As genie — transports self and up to eight linked creatures among elemental planes, Astral, or Material (caster level per SRD genie entry).</p><p><strong>Telepathy:</strong> Standard range per statistics.</p>",
